            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "9YK01",
              "name": "qaNote",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "RDBX6",
                  "name": "qaNoteTitle",
                  "fill": "#222222",
                  "content": "关键需求标注",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "RzlbU",
                  "name": "qaNoteWrap",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "#F7F7F7",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "padding": 16,
                  "gap": 10,
                  "cornerRadius": 6,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "TkIDU",
                      "name": "qaNote0",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "1. 问答前必须取当前会话的用户身份、直属部门与角色集合；未登录不可问答。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "m18gN",
                      "name": "qaNote1",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "2. 召回 top_k 放大 5 倍（补偿鉴权过滤损耗），且按 doc_id **一次 IN 查询**取权限，避免 N+1。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "K7jtJ",
                      "name": "qaNote2",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "3. 鉴权未通过的切片**绝不进入 Prompt**——不是“让模型别说”，而是根本不给它。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "FT1Eb",
                      "name": "qaNote3",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "4. denied 非空时，必须在回答中显式标注「部分参考资料因权限受限无法展示」（PRD 2.9.4 硬要求）。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "UP1Wi",
                      "name": "qaNote4",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "5. 回答必须附知识引用溯源卡片；点击可定位到原文切片。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "9tYpN",
                      "name": "qaNote5",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "6. 每轮问答异步落 qa_logs：记录 recalled / allowed / denied 三个切片列表 + Token + 分段耗时。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "cYuHY",
                      "name": "qaNote6",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "7. SSE 流式订阅 /qa/stream/{task_id} 时必须校验该 task 归属当前用户，防止越权窃听。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
